Open XML SDK schema data
------------------------

xtask/codegen/input/ holds files copied unchanged from the data/ directory of
https://github.com/dotnet/Open-XML-SDK at commit 431ab05cf160248cc3885a4a766026d4f8243792.
cargo xtask codegen reads them to generate the tables under
crates/stetdoc-core/src/schema/generated/. The licence text is in
xtask/codegen/input/LICENSE-Open-XML-SDK.

