Open-Xml-PowerTools revision processing
---------------------------------------

The semantics of accepting and rejecting tracked changes in crates/stetdoc-core/src/revisions/ follow the
RevisionProcessor of https://github.com/OfficeDev/Open-Xml-PowerTools, and the algorithms are written again
in Rust. docs/design/revisions.md, section 6.4, lists where stetdoc differs from it. Its test documents
(the RP series, with the output that it made for them) are used by the differential test in
crates/stetdoc-core/src/revisions/tests_oxpt.rs and are recorded in corpus/SOURCES.md.

